# Agent definitions

- These markdown files are **production prompts** loaded into
  `APPEND_SYSTEM_PROMPT` / workflow prompts. Edit for clarity and correctness.
- Preserve ownership boundaries from `agents/README.md` (who may touch what).
- Keep Assayer standards aligned with what Miner/Smith are told to produce.
- Model/routing changes belong in workflows + `docs/MODEL-ROUTING.md`, not
  buried only inside role prose.
- After material rubric changes, plan a small golden-set or smoke run before
  relying on the next cron batch.
